      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Start by emphasizing our shared commitment to employee health and safety, acknowledging the unique challenges of remote work where ergonomics can be overlooked. Clearly outline actionable guidelines, such as positioning monitors at eye level, ensuring proper chair support, and establishing regular micro-breaks to stretch and prevent repetitive strain injuries. Conclude by offering dedicated resources, including ergonomic assessments and reimbursement for necessary equipment, to demonstrate our sincere support for your well-being.",
