    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start. I'm particularly worried about people experiencing those small, nagging pains in their wrists or necks that they might ignore at first. How can I frame the importance of addressing those \"tiny aches\" early on so they don't turn into something serious?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
