    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. I want to make sure they don't just feel like it's their own fault for being \"clumsy\" or not sitting right. Could you maybe add a section that describes how these little aches can feel like they're almost \"sneaking up\" on you or working against you when you're trying to focus?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
