      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is a common misperception that pain is solely a choice, but rather an unwelcome signal that your workstation is secretly yanking you in the wrong direction. These subtle discomforts often operate like a slow-vine in the back of your mind, distracting your focus and draining your energy without you realizing the specific trigger. We encourage viewing these sensations as helpful data points rather than personal failures, allowing us to collaborate on solutions that bring your work back so you can focus again.",
